Third-party components
----------------------
This product includes software from:
  * amneziawg-installer — Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Ivan Bondarev, MIT License
    https://github.com/bivlked/amneziawg-installer
  * golang.org/x/crypto, golang.org/x/sys and the Go standard library —
    Copyright 2009 The Go Authors, BSD-3-Clause License

At runtime the RU server also downloads lists of Russian IPv4 networks from
https://github.com/antonme/GeoIP (derived from MaxMind GeoLite2 data, subject to the
GeoLite2 EULA) and https://github.com/v2fly/geoip (IP Geolocation by DB-IP,
https://db-ip.com, CC BY 4.0), and — if domain routing is enabled — a list of
Russian service domains from https://github.com/lib4u/amnezia-tunneling-ru
(based on v2fly/domain-list-community). These lists are not distributed with
this product. Domain routing uses dnsmasq installed from the server's OS packages.

